I’m from the Data Product Optimization POC team. Thank you for sharing the production data earlier based on our previous query.

We have now updated the query and would like to request the recent 90 days of data using this revised version. I have attached an Excel sheet that includes the updated query for your reference.

Additionally, it would be helpful if you could share the column-level information (such as column names and descriptions) for the listed tables mentioned in the sheet.

